{"runId":"denied-dashboard-2026-09-06","accountLabel":"F1 Finance Officer","groupId":"D19","area":"Dashboard","step":3,"question":"那只解释任务总览和注意事项有什么区别，不用读取我的数据。","conversationId":"conv_c31d37b6cc6e4112ad3e","accepted":true,"duplicate":false,"timedOut":false,"maxSeq":30,"durationMs":24010,"skillId":"admin_portal_reader","category":"portal_reader","reader":{"result":"not_confirmed","page":"","section":"","sourceSection":"","selectedState":"","scope":"unknown","workflowState":"","answerShape":"unspecified","completeness":"unknown","facts":[],"missing":["portal_read_required"]},"plan":{"facts":[],"missing":[]},"actionEvidence":[],"answer":"在常见的任务管理界面中，“任务总览”和“注意事项”是两种不同性质的内容：\n\n- **任务总览**：通常以列表、卡片或图表的形式展示当前任务的概要信息，例如任务名称、类型、数量、状态、负责人、截止时间等，目的是帮您快速掌握整体工作负载和进度。\n- **注意事项**：一般是一段或几段提示性文字，列出在查看或处理任务时需要特别留意的规则、限制、潜在风险或操作提醒，目的是防止误操作或误解。\n\n简单来说：任务总览回答“有哪些任务、现在是什么情况”，注意事项回答“做这些事项时需要特别留意什么”。具体到您自己的仪表板界面，实际含义请以页面内自带的帮助说明或悬停提示为准。","terminalEvent":"turn.completed","eventTypes":["user.message","turn.started","assistant.status","skill.route","reader.result","assistant.message","turn.completed"],"auditEvidence":[{"recordType":"reader.evidence","category":"dsh","payload":{"facts":[],"missing":[],"stage":"planning_required_portal","rootCause":"portal_read_required","qualityTrace":[{"stage":"question_context","status":"passed","failureCode":"","durationMs":"0"},{"stage":"identity_permissions","status":"passed","failureCode":"","durationMs":"281"},{"stage":"knowledge_retrieval","status":"passed","failureCode":"","durationMs":"1035.4"},{"stage":"planning","status":"passed","failureCode":"","durationMs":"1216.8"},{"stage":"planning","status":"passed","failureCode":"","durationMs":"1765.6"},{"stage":"result_classification","status":"failed","failureCode":"portal_read_required","durationMs":"0"}],"permission":{"fingerprint":"d41b7f639223ec9b2b206416bb1b469f58be3172839b7e7f4df8ba8b0521ee6d","roles":["Finance Officer"],"departments":["5"]},"knowledge":{"ok":true,"code":"ok","sources":["Dashboa